                    <signifLet xml:id="m-79ab12aa-9446-418b-b8a6-9d76c9df3306" /></nc><nc xml:id="m-dce16578-2959-44f7-a3a8-ff3980363dcf" pname="d" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><divLine xml:id="m-3ceb73d8-37b2-4784-a2c8-ef5afe5ec0e2" facs="#m-f2d64579-d1b0-4ea7-81c6-2640658301fc" form="finalis" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-3eb10961-f11c-4fd9-a948-e3947494cfd4"><lg xml:id="m-52d1fa26-e4d5-480f-ad3e-b919044f0411"><l xml:id="m-d86310ae-4cda-4c9d-bec6-4f957c5fb333" facs="#m-51348022-1cda-4485-abaf-71d7dbf26586" label="ambiguous">14e8</l><l xml:id="m-c2480186-12b6-4569-85e7-92cadfcb7c2a" facs="#m-7f30f63e-fa7b-4940-b15e-0ef125f936a3" label="ambiguous">May 14.</l><l xml:id="m-c501ab0e-f192-40d5-88ea-01d38e9bdfe5" facs="#m-2fce9a91-1f30-4476-b641-26dbe94e653d" label="ambiguous">fi-li- ae</l><l xml:id="m-07d81023-3d67-4f25-a6d8-c8043651c040" facs="#m-1f23f82f-c731-4ab9-9548-d15e30e9147f" label="lyrics-like">in pór-tis</l><l xml:id="m-20d81226-6a82-4623-93a0-f233f94d24a4" facs="#m-998020a2-6c75-4201-8ae4-bcebad3b31a3" label="ambiguous">Si¬</l><l xml:id="m-80ce90e0-c59f-4d2e-9271-056fa1b8aff6" facs="#m-25f9ce8a-ed39-40cd-8e02-0381c4fdc3e8" label="text-like">on. Alle¬</l><l xml:id="m-362b293f-2c80-4719-92e6-7b1d12d341e7" facs="#m-1b83883d-87e6-40fc-8061-46f9d4de1cfb" label="lyrics-like">lú-ia.</l><l xml:id="m-4380ed00-f789-43c5-aab0-c122c61065de" facs="#m-b33f2c39-be63-4f6b-80a0-ff0325413696" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-73870cc1-c343-4c01-a2f8-7da985e2794c" facs="#m-e9964d53-4dfa-4f2f-a088-cab00c7f3f02" label="lyrics-like">Ostias tibi, Dómine, in odórem! plis edócti, per sémitam mandató¬</l><l xml:id="m-50670b1d-3ab6-4a09-9652-c30108d1443c" facs="#m-37b11d7b-db12-4438-9dc7-de17920d7b74" label="lyrics-like">It suavitátis offérimus; et praesta, lrum tuórum dilatáto corde currá¬</l><l xml:id="m-4a26d30e-24cf-421b-9d59-449e036990ca" facs="#m-e3db9be1-c3b9-4d23-ad49-eac96f13629f" label="lyrics-like">ut beáti Robérti mónitis et exém-Imus. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-aacead19-2a87-48cf-a782-982c0d888bc6" facs="#m-e9b06e3b-57dc-4134-8820-cb71db98190b" label="ambiguous">comm.4</l><l xml:id="m-99685f43-c70d-4957-ad54-00c4e6147ab6" facs="#m-8d6e5b4a-c2ab-4ff4-8e17-38e45993cea2" label="ambiguous">l.</l><l xml:id="m-8914347d-ef57-45fe-a4d6-3a52351a48ca" facs="#m-f872cbe5-4d5b-456e-a930-c80bb6cacd18" label="lyrics-like">OS éstis lux múndi : "“sic lúce-at lux véstra coram</l><l xml:id="m-b164a3ad-8bfa-4341-b3a0-ce5ce234eede" facs="#m-748c6990-b7f1-45d5-a2da-f6041532e7c6" label="lyrics-like">homí-nibus, ut víde-ant ópe-ra véstra bó-na</l><l xml:id="m-d4ddcd62-e55d-4d29-83de-cde3d82e2fb7" facs="#m-6b4aac9d-986f-4e4c-ad76-2e3ccaaa6b74" label="lyrics-like">et glorí¬</l><l xml:id="m-3ddfebc4-c406-4a88-8c43-1e1200d6c780" facs="#m-f4c80920-d688-4547-aac1-d8c29c1783b1" label="lyrics-like">ficent Pâtrem véstrum qui in caélis est. Alle¬</l><l xml:id="m-aa5cd07a-786d-4956-86d3-fac492376350" facs="#m-f3b6a1c9-f1c4-4a85-a073-47315e9c746b" label="lyrics-like">lú- ia.</l><l xml:id="m-abf67aa6-dc70-4821-99c4-60efd79fc0c8" facs="#m-baef9e7e-5eb1-470b-92dc-26595cb591d3" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-3e9c28af-aa6f-4a95-b0e8-06a56a322265" facs="#m-7835ba82-6f30-46f0-81e0-5cbaf1fdac2c" label="lyrics-like">NAcraménta, quae súmpsimus, l beátus Robértus veheménter accén¬</l><l xml:id="m-d7210189-953a-4677-a180-7c5296290b5e" facs="#m-f4c374ea-b85c-4fdc-a779-3ece361a0319" label="lyrics-like">O Dómine Deus noster, in nobis sus, pro Ecclésia tua se júgiter im¬</l><l xml:id="m-c3e5270c-e5ea-4623-80d4-8f9a53c5459d" facs="#m-fd1ebcc4-5220-4ac4-a9ac-56093554e18f" label="lyrics-like">foveant caritátis ardórem: quol pendébat. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-72a34310-7f33-4da7-9fff-1154766824a5" facs="#m-968e912a-e411-402f-8f7c-bc06751caace" label="ambiguous">14.</l><l xml:id="m-81cec71f-00e4-48e2-8dda-d4b3a01e862b" facs="#m-add3ff5d-84a3-4685-b5f3-aaa1b068745c" label="ambiguous">St. Boniface, Martyr.</l><l xml:id="m-48df894c-1349-43f8-8d46-695d7ebca11f" facs="#m-db27d6c6-d161-4d65-a1d9-cc0353fa5ee7" label="ambiguous">Simple.</l><l xml:id="m-0aa07683-5d3a-4873-b708-a56f97a12eec" facs="#m-74d6e3bc-f767-4837-97c6-a8a710acdd7c" label="ambiguous">Collect</l><l xml:id="m-ebf12eb8-55ae-4f94-a13b-3ea9d4792174" facs="#m-b0734a94-ce58-4391-9f9b-a0b4aaef2e1f" label="lyrics-like">A, quaésumus, omnípotens ] ejus apud te intercessiónibus adju¬</l><l xml:id="m-229e11f2-23ca-471e-b884-63d6b47434e2" facs="#m-dd060daf-4d10-4e0e-b2a8-f4f94c3be432" label="lyrics-like">U peus:t ut qui beáti Bonifátii ] vémur. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-b5d20dba-f1f4-462c-bf75-82befbe3387d" facs="#m-fc34caac-8438-48ac-9ed3-f5693e9fe4fa" label="lyrics-like">Mártyris tui solèmnia cólimus,</l><l xml:id="m-d78cc2ea-1c74-43ed-8946-238f096eee9b" facs="#m-5c0b1644-3d23-48bc-8a1a-5c295b9d45b0" label="lyrics-like">Secret. Munéribus nostris. p. 1188. Postcommunion. Refécti. p. 1141.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
